{"kind":"artifact","text":"Candidate: the status projection and its rendering at internal/statusview on exact head b3b47533cfdd6e414bd1462ce21d41f15aaa0861. gs status now has a Dissents section: standing objections, each naming the act it is recorded against, taken from the dissent's first basis. Retired dissents are withdrawn and omitted. The section precedes non-effective attempts because a dissent objects to something that did take force while an attempt never did. Before this a dissent appeared in no commitment lane, no artifact list and no section, so the human page showed an approval as unopposed while the log recorded an objection to it.","body":{"commit":"b3b47533cfdd6e414bd1462ce21d41f15aaa0861","path":"internal/statusview"}}